    "Hand-written raw-spec.json (the shape extract.lua dumps), used by checks.resolve-sources.",
    "Hand-written rather than extracted so this fixture holds exactly the URL forms the accept",
    "matrix means to cover, independent of how a given lazy.nvim happens to normalize a spec",
    "(the same reason tests/fixtures/merge/raw-spec-base.json gives).",
    "No plugin here has a `version`: constraint resolution needs a real (or locally faked) git",
    "remote, and this fixture is meant to stay fully offline -- that path is",
    "checks.resolve-semver's job instead.",
    "This table is the accept half of docs/plans/28-validate-plugin-sources.md's URL matrix",
    "(§3.2), and pairs with docs/architecture.md's 'lazy spec -> flake input URL mapping' table.",
    "trailing.nvim / httpgh.nvim / upperhost.nvim exist specifically to pin the plan's §3.4",
    "invariant: none of the three appears in any other fixture, so nothing else in the tree would",
    "catch a regression that widened github.com classification to also match http:// or a",
    "case-different host."
  ],
